          "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "For sufficiently large arrays, OpenMP tasks on the disjoint recursive quicksort ranges can use the available CPU cores while retaining the serial partition loop whose boundary index has a loop-carried dependency. A task-size cutoff should limit scheduling overhead; serializing pivot RNG draws avoids races without changing the sorted result.",
