        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "Storing each group in contiguous x and y coordinate planes should make the point scan more cache-friendly than interleaved Point records. A bounded max-heap keeps candidate storage O(k) and uses encounter order to preserve stable distance-tie selection.",
