          "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "The top-k insertion search must preserve first-match order, so a SIMD min-index reduction that scans every slot can lose to a scalar early exit. Replacing the dependent overlapping shifts with memmove may let the target C library use optimized vector moves while preserving exact order.",
