          "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "Replacing insertion sort's loop-carried shifts with qsort should avoid quadratic work for disordered buckets. After counting and prefixing, each bucket owns a disjoint index range, so sorting those ranges in parallel is race-free; bucket counting and scatter remain serial because their updates can collide.",
