          "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "Chunked SIMD reductions should cut modulo operations in each matrix-product dot product, while static row-level OpenMP work sharing accelerates larger products and avoids parallel-region overhead for small dimensions.",
          "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
            "files": [
