            ],
            "retained": [
              "Compute each dot product in chunks of at most 16 products and reduce each chunk with an OpenMP SIMD reduction before applying modulo.",
              "Use static OpenMP row work sharing for matrix dimensions of at least 32; use a serial row loop below that threshold.",
              "Route pointer-based multiplication through the const-reference implementation so both call forms use the same kernel."
            ]
