          "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "Four-row output tiles may reuse each contiguous transposed RHS row across multiple results, while bounded 16-product SIMD reductions and static work-sharing expose efficient parallel work without changing the modular result.",
          "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
