          "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "Unrolling the legal NEON prefix scan by two vectors may reduce loop-control overhead and expose independent local-prefix work to the compiler, while carrying the first vector's final residue into the second preserves the horizontal recurrence.",
          "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
